SEGRAVE)
Dr. Aldrich moved to adopt with acknowledgment of relief to reduce lot frontage from 30’ to 27’
for DD8 single-family lots not facing open space, and subject to the applicant making technical
corrections prior to recording of the plat, seconded by Dr. Emmons. Motion carried by unanimous
voice vote.
Connor White, Planning & Development Department, provided a staff report.
David Gregg,
Mission Homes and builder for the development, provided additional information along with
examples of previous development projects. Mayor Patrick Collins voiced support for the project.
Seth Lloyd, Planning & Development Department, provided information related to previously
approved UDC code amendments and their usage providing relief for affordable housing.
Committee members Aldrich and Emmons commented on the item.
